          "@type": "bootstrap:Skill",
          "ambiguous": false,
          "description": "A person's verdict on a machine translation, carried from the translation review page to the record: the reviewer accepts a catalogue, or flags a mistranslation and picks a candidate or writes their own text; the verdict is filed as a `translation-adjudication/v1` issue; a workflow checks the author and the catalogue's hash, writes the records and opens a PR; a maintainer merges it. Use for \"review the translations\", \"this string is mistranslated\", \"why was my review not recorded\", and when wiring a layer for review. Locale sign-off is a separate act, not this one.",
